WEBVTT

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:05.088
Sorena told me to protect her...

00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:07.966
Huh? Sorena?

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:13.597
Yeah, Sorena asked me to protect her granddaughter.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:16.058
That's why I'm out here...

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.727
Does she have the Grimoire of Zero?

00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:20.812
How the hell should I know?

00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:21.688
| see.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.649
Wait, wait, she has it! Probably!

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:24.525
No, well, uh...

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.236
she's the one who's closest to Him!

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:32.741
Suppose I'll hear you out, Mister Wolf.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:38.121
God, you sure are a thorn in my side, Dog.

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:40.457
| told you, I'm a WOLF!

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:44.962
Want me to explain to you the differences
between a dog and a wolf?!

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:47.965
Ow, ow, ow...

00:00:47.965 --> 00:00:50.968
| don't care what you are,
but if you don't keep quiet, you'll die.

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:52.302
You should care!

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:58.559
Sorena personally imbued me with the soul of a wolf!

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.395
You were human before?

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:03.021
Yeah.

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:08.277
You were born this way,
but I made my own decision to become a beast.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.207
GRIMOIRE OF ZERO

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:25.877
GRIMOIRE OF ZERO

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:28.714
No matter how I stretch, it won't reach

00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:31.508
No matter how hard I think

00:01:31.592 --> 00:01:37.055
It's still not enough, my legs hurt too much to press on!

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.725
It has such a pretty color

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:42.394
And looks so juicy swaying back and forth

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:47.649
I'm not hungry but I want to try it

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:53.488
“| won't stop even if you say I'm being mean."

00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:56.283
"You should ask me for help sometimes!"

00:01:56.283 --> 00:01:58.952
It comes to me in a flash

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:04.625
Discover! Is friendship just a fantasy?

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:12.007
Give it a try, the thing I realized the most

00:02:12.007 --> 00:02:17.471
Is it sweet or sour? It's kind of exciting

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:23.101
| found it being with all of you

00:02:23.185 --> 00:02:28.440
A special word like magic

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.652
| won't let go

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.322
Of this meeting

00:02:39.743 --> 00:02:43.664
EPISODE 8 SORENA'S GRANDDAUGHTER

00:02:50.504 --> 00:02:54.132
| was an established knight
stationed at the Royal Palace.

00:02:54.675 --> 00:02:56.968
Wait, you're nobility?! You?!

00:02:57.427 --> 00:02:58.428
Yeah.

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:00.764
Well, I guess I got that noble air about me.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:04.267
Can't hide how well I was raised.

00:03:06.812 --> 00:03:09.189
Ow, hey! Ow, ow!

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:10.107
Whoops.

00:03:10.107 --> 00:03:11.441
C'mon!

00:03:11.441 --> 00:03:12.776
You made me laugh.

00:03:12.776 --> 00:03:14.486
It's not funny!

00:03:14.486 --> 00:03:18.990
You saw my knightly swordsmanship
when we went head to head, didn't you, brother?!

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:20.409
Don't remember.

00:03:20.992 --> 00:03:21.868
Sheesh.

00:03:22.536 --> 00:03:26.957
Well, I was the third son of a noble family,
so it wasn't my right to carry on the heritage,

00:03:26.957 --> 00:03:29.626
and I only joined the service reluctantly.

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:32.045
Say "ahh"!

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:32.963
Ahh!

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:37.509
You lecherous bastard!

00:03:37.509 --> 00:03:38.427
Darling?!

00:03:38.969 --> 00:03:39.845
Duel me!

00:03:43.014 --> 00:03:43.932
Don't run from me!

00:03:44.558 --> 00:03:45.892
If you're a knight, then draw your blade!

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:46.685
But an incident with a woman caused a scene.
If you're a knight, then draw your blade!

00:03:46.685 --> 00:03:47.728
But an incident with a woman caused a scene.

00:03:47.728 --> 00:03:48.687
But an incident with a woman caused a scene.
Wait!

00:03:48.687 --> 00:03:49.646
But an incident with a woman caused a scene.

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:57.279
| exhausted myself escaping,
and just when I'd collapsed...

00:04:00.365 --> 00:04:03.910
Don't think I'd mind dyin' if I've got
a pretty God of Death helpin' me.

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:07.914
Calling me a God of Death is an interesting greeting.

00:04:08.623 --> 00:04:11.376
| am a witch. The people call me
Sorena, the Mooncaller Witch.

00:04:14.629 --> 00:04:15.630
| feel alive again!

00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:20.177
That your kid?

00:04:20.844 --> 00:04:22.220
My grandchild.

00:04:22.763 --> 00:04:26.433
The child's parents are gone,
so I am raising them myself.

00:04:27.851 --> 00:04:30.187
Hey, could I stick with you for a bit?

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:33.857
I'I do anything for you. Cooking, babysitting...

00:04:34.483 --> 00:04:37.277
| have no need for a cowardly human manservant.

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.655
Then make me into a monster.

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:43.033
| don't care much what happens to this body.

00:04:44.284 --> 00:04:46.578
Come, you can walk now, yes?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.915
Stop spouting off foolish things and get out of the forest.

00:04:49.915 --> 00:04:51.082
W-wait!

00:04:53.502 --> 00:04:55.462
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:57.005 --> 00:04:58.465
Looks like she likes me.

00:05:22.739 --> 00:05:26.409
Once I became a beastfallen,
| didn't have to worry about them goin' after me.

00:05:26.952 --> 00:05:29.704
Witches are gonna go after your head, though.

00:05:30.247 --> 00:05:33.375
Things were peaceful when I made the transformation.

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:38.505
You're right, the witches in Wenias
have only been revolting just recently.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:44.344
And the witches that are attacking are all weak witches
who couldn't even make a man beastleaven!

00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:50.934
The only people bu yin' heads off the market
are wives of noblemen obsessed with demonic rituals.

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:52.435
Huh...

00:05:52.811 --> 00:05:56.815
So Zero had no reason to be
goin' after my head in the first place.

00:06:00.527 --> 00:06:01.736
Where is Zero?

00:06:02.404 --> 00:06:04.656
| will ask you one final time...

00:06:04.865 --> 00:06:06.449
consider your answer carefully.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:12.372
Join with me and purge the witches,
ending this futile war,

00:06:12.873 --> 00:06:15.959
or be burned at the stake.

00:06:16.626 --> 00:06:18.962
You sure are passionate about me joining you.

00:06:19.254 --> 00:06:22.132
Aren't there plenty of other sorcerers you could ask?

00:06:22.549 --> 00:06:24.759
No, there is only one of you.

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:27.512
You know why I am so insistent.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:37.814
That's how I came to live with Sorena,
living the easy life as her granddaughter's caretaker.

00:06:43.278 --> 00:06:47.782
Dammit! The villagers burned through the barrier
and are headin' this way!

00:06:48.158 --> 00:06:49.910
| told 'em it was a misunderstanding!

00:06:50.535 --> 00:06:52.829
Many have died from this plague.

00:06:53.121 --> 00:06:55.749
They will not be sated until they kill a witch.

00:06:56.499 --> 00:06:58.835
Then I'll kill all of 'em!

00:07:00.837 --> 00:07:05.550
If you do that, I will truly become an evil witch.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:06.468
I'd do it!

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:08.261
I'd do it to protect you!

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:12.390
At this rate, the forest is doomed.

00:07:12.891 --> 00:07:14.643
You will be, too.

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:17.187
| must allow myself to be captured.

00:07:17.395 --> 00:07:18.355
No!

00:07:19.606 --> 00:07:23.234
Your legs will allow you to escape with my grandchild.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.030
No, I'm staying!

00:07:27.322 --> 00:07:28.031
I'm staying!

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:33.286
Holdem, I have never felt more glad
to have you as a manservant than this day.

00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:35.747
Sorena...

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.917
Take care of my grandchild.

00:07:46.675 --> 00:07:50.178
Sorena was wrongfully killed.

00:07:51.429 --> 00:07:55.475
Her granddaughter swore vengeance against them
and went her own way.

00:07:56.643 --> 00:07:59.229
| wasn't just foolin' around all this time.

00:07:59.771 --> 00:08:01.606
| was desperately gathering information,

00:08:01.856 --> 00:08:05.151
and found out that she'd joined up
with the Sorcerers of Zero.

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:11.282
A little while ago, I was lookin' for the Grimoire of Zero,
and ended up in their hideout.

00:08:11.449 --> 00:08:13.410
Really?! And?

00:08:13.994 --> 00:08:19.708
Sorena's granddaughter and Him had escaped
long before us, and the book was gone, too.

00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:21.042
| see.

00:08:21.668 --> 00:08:25.255
He never shows his face, so he can't have the book.

00:08:25.839 --> 00:08:28.049
That means she's gotta have it.

00:08:29.217 --> 00:08:32.762
So, why were you looking
for the Grimoire of Zero, brother?

00:08:33.388 --> 00:08:36.683
Was gonna be a present for my employer.

00:08:37.684 --> 00:08:40.854
Dunno if she'll forgive me if I get it to her, though...

00:08:49.738 --> 00:08:54.117
That bastard Thirteen
is still so unskilled at healing magic.

00:09:08.715 --> 00:09:09.841
A barrier...

00:09:10.425 --> 00:09:13.094
He's already considered the fact
that I would try to escape.

00:09:13.595 --> 00:09:16.514
Thirteen, you only grow more detestable.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:25.607
Mercenary, your ridiculous strength
would be of much use right now...

00:09:27.609 --> 00:09:31.571
Sorena was against the Sorcerers of Zero
from the beginning.

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:36.076
She thought magic was great,
but it wasn't being spread correctly.

00:09:36.743 --> 00:09:39.913
That's something my employer needs to hear.

00:09:40.538 --> 00:09:43.041
That's why He had her burned at the stake.

00:09:44.084 --> 00:09:49.005
Hold it, I thought Sorena was burned to death
by the villagers 'cause of the plague!

00:09:49.923 --> 00:09:51.216
Think about it.

00:09:51.674 --> 00:09:55.428
What if He were the one behind the plague?

00:09:56.012 --> 00:10:00.892
So you're saying he deliberately caused
a misunderstanding with the villagers, and...

00:10:01.976 --> 00:10:03.478
...screwed Sorena over?

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.105
You got proof?

00:10:05.105 --> 00:10:05.814
Nope.

00:10:06.523 --> 00:10:09.192
But I believe it.

00:10:10.401 --> 00:10:12.779
You want to kill all witches,
even the witches that want peace,

00:10:12.779 --> 00:10:15.615
just because there are some witches
that use magic for evil?

00:10:15.615 --> 00:10:16.741
That's not right!

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:21.538
Humans consider all users of magic
to be one and the same.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.748
They cannot tell good from evil.

00:10:24.082 --> 00:10:26.543
Wouldn't it be better if we took out the rogue witches first,

00:10:26.543 --> 00:10:30.755
then spread the knowledge of magic correctly,
as Sorena suggested?

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:34.509
That is much too leisurely for a kingdom at war.

00:10:35.593 --> 00:10:40.181
But then humans and witches
could coexist with magic, just as Zero's sa-

00:10:40.181 --> 00:10:44.227
Then why don't you call forth your Sorcerers
when you are tied to the stake,

00:10:44.227 --> 00:10:45.603
and tell them to strike me down?

00:10:45.812 --> 00:10:50.900
Still, that would be no different,
as magic would be used as a weapon.

00:10:52.068 --> 00:10:53.236
It is time.

00:10:53.444 --> 00:10:58.658
A witch always strives to achieve
the best possible outcome for themselves.

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:01.327
| do not need to hear your answer.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:06.416
Don't show that gloomy face of yours
around me ever again.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.543
Very well.

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:13.464
Then I will use your life to its full potential
to aid my cause.

00:11:24.142 --> 00:11:27.562
Hey, what's your employer up to now, brother?

00:11:28.188 --> 00:11:30.023
None of your goddamn business.

00:11:30.565 --> 00:11:32.734
Nah, it kinda is.

00:11:33.526 --> 00:11:36.738
| smelled her granddaughter on your companion.

00:11:37.864 --> 00:11:43.661
Usually witches smell like herbs or incense
which cover up those smells, but I caught a whiff.

00:11:44.204 --> 00:11:45.914
You don't smell her on me?

00:11:46.456 --> 00:11:49.542
Beastfallen always smell so bad I can't tell.

00:11:50.251 --> 00:11:53.504
Hurry! We'll miss the witch execution!

00:11:54.172 --> 00:11:55.840
Sure are lots of carts.

00:11:58.468 --> 00:11:59.260
Don't tell me...

00:11:59.469 --> 00:12:00.720
Brother? What's-

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:01.804
That idiot!

00:12:02.347 --> 00:12:04.307
Change of plans, Dog-face!

00:12:04.474 --> 00:12:06.309
We're headin' to Plasta first!

00:12:06.643 --> 00:12:08.353
What the hell is with you all of a sudden?!

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.355
That stupid brat...

00:12:10.647 --> 00:12:12.732
He went against Thirteen's wishes!

00:12:23.952 --> 00:12:24.994
Brother!

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:26.913
Brother, c'mon!

00:12:26.913 --> 00:12:27.830
What?!

00:12:28.081 --> 00:12:31.334
| know you wanna save your friend,
but with all these people here?!

00:12:31.542 --> 00:12:32.835
You're crazy!

00:12:33.086 --> 00:12:35.171
I'm not sure if it's my companion yet.

00:12:35.713 --> 00:12:37.715
So if it's your friend, what're you gonna do?

00:12:38.091 --> 00:12:39.884
I'll figure it out then!

00:12:40.176 --> 00:12:40.969
What?!

00:12:47.934 --> 00:12:48.726
Hey!

00:12:49.102 --> 00:12:51.062
| have to look for her granddaughter!

00:12:51.354 --> 00:12:53.398
| can't die here!

00:12:53.773 --> 00:12:56.401
No matter what you might ask of me, I can't-

00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:08.037
| knew it!

00:13:08.162 --> 00:13:09.539
It's that stupid kid!

00:13:10.498 --> 00:13:11.666
That's her...

00:13:11.833 --> 00:13:14.460
"Her"? He's a guy.

00:13:15.128 --> 00:13:18.840
| finally found her! Brother, that's her!

00:13:22.969 --> 00:13:24.137
HE'S...

00:13:25.555 --> 00:13:27.890
...Sorena's granddaughter?

00:13:45.033 --> 00:13:48.077
Today, we burn a witch at the stake.

00:13:48.953 --> 00:13:51.914
Do not feel pity for his young age.

00:13:52.582 --> 00:13:57.587
Think of the countless humans
this witch has killed so far,

00:13:58.087 --> 00:14:01.424
and the countless humans he will kill in the future.

00:14:02.258 --> 00:14:06.179
| am a sorcerer who uses sorcery.

00:14:06.637 --> 00:14:10.933
But I would never use sorcery to harm another person.

00:14:11.642 --> 00:14:14.479
We cannot allow one to harm another!

00:14:15.355 --> 00:14:21.152
Fellow citizens, I will spare no effort in purging those
who have strayed from righteousness.

00:14:21.819 --> 00:14:27.992
Please understand, it is not sorcery that is evil,
but the witches themselves who are evil!

00:14:28.993 --> 00:14:30.787
Who the hell is that?

00:14:31.245 --> 00:14:32.288
This ain't good.

00:14:32.789 --> 00:14:34.874
| get it 'cause he tricked me, too.

00:14:35.208 --> 00:14:38.044
He stirs people up with his lying words
to get them on his side.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:42.632
That crook, he's trying to manipulate the people!

00:14:42.965 --> 00:14:48.721
Fellow citizens, I will employ all the power
in my possession to establish peace in our kingdom!

00:14:49.138 --> 00:14:56.104
| swear to eradicate all the evil witches,
and protect the land of Wenias with sorcery!

00:14:56.437 --> 00:14:57.563
That is why...

00:14:57.939 --> 00:14:59.065
---I---

00:14:59.273 --> 00:15:01.150
...burn witches to death!

00:15:05.321 --> 00:15:06.531
Brother, let's go!

00:15:06.906 --> 00:15:08.699
If we don't get a move on we'll be too late!

00:15:09.075 --> 00:15:11.536
Wait, this is the worst time to go out there.

00:15:12.495 --> 00:15:14.747
Zero, what're you doing?

00:15:15.331 --> 00:15:18.000
We need your power right now.

00:15:18.292 --> 00:15:19.252
Listen to me...

00:15:20.211 --> 00:15:21.337
my comrades!

00:15:21.671 --> 00:15:22.130
Wha-?!

00:15:22.713 --> 00:15:26.008
Today, my body will be reduced to ash!

00:15:26.884 --> 00:15:29.011
Listen, my brethren!

00:15:29.971 --> 00:15:33.349
All of you who fight for the liberation of witches!

00:15:33.975 --> 00:15:37.937
Just as the flames that consumed Sorena
called you to battle,

00:15:38.604 --> 00:15:42.900
the flames that consume me
will call you to battle once more!

00:15:43.693 --> 00:15:48.281
Come together, all you witches
who desire peace and harmony!

00:15:49.699 --> 00:15:53.369
| am descended from the Mooncaller who ruled the land!

00:15:53.744 --> 00:15:55.788
| carry Sorena's blood within me!

00:15:56.497 --> 00:15:59.083
In the name of the great Sorena...

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.502
strike down Thirteen!

00:16:14.098 --> 00:16:15.475
Young lady!

00:16:17.226 --> 00:16:18.644
Hey, wait, Dog-face!

00:16:20.188 --> 00:16:20.730
Dammit!

00:16:22.482 --> 00:16:23.691
Move, move!

00:16:23.691 --> 00:16:26.652
Out of the way! Clear a path!

00:16:32.408 --> 00:16:33.451
Dog-face!

00:16:34.118 --> 00:16:35.578
You're not stopping me!

00:16:35.786 --> 00:16:37.079
| know!

00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:39.916
You get up there and get the kid!

00:16:40.124 --> 00:16:40.917
What about you?

00:16:41.918 --> 00:16:44.712
I'll scare 'em with a loud bang!

00:16:57.141 --> 00:16:58.309
What is happening?

00:16:58.643 --> 00:17:01.395
Did that damn sorcerer fail?!

00:17:01.604 --> 00:17:03.022
Call for reinforcements!

00:17:03.022 --> 00:17:03.606
Yes, sir!

00:17:05.066 --> 00:17:07.902
Sorcerer of the State, it's too dangerous.

00:17:10.488 --> 00:17:11.822
Grandmother...

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:13.699
Run!

00:17:13.866 --> 00:17:15.660
The witches are attacking!

00:17:17.662 --> 00:17:19.997
You there! Cease your resistance!

00:17:20.206 --> 00:17:24.043
Anyone who doesn't wanna die
should keep their heads down!

00:17:24.752 --> 00:17:25.836
Young lady!

00:17:37.181 --> 00:17:39.058
Here they come.

00:17:41.894 --> 00:17:43.896
Young lady! Young lady!

00:17:46.315 --> 00:17:49.277
C'mon, we gotta get outta here!

00:17:49.485 --> 00:17:50.319
Alright!

00:17:52.238 --> 00:17:52.989
Okay.

00:17:54.532 --> 00:17:55.366
Hup!

00:18:01.789 --> 00:18:03.291
Beast warrior...

00:18:04.333 --> 00:18:05.960
Thirteen...

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:14.802
It's too dangerous!

00:18:15.094 --> 00:18:16.470
Stay back!

00:18:17.972 --> 00:18:19.640
Stop! You'll hit Zero!

00:18:21.058 --> 00:18:22.184
Zero?

00:18:22.476 --> 00:18:23.853
What does that mean?

00:18:26.188 --> 00:18:27.398
Have another.

00:18:31.027 --> 00:18:32.862
After him! Don't let him get away!

00:18:38.826 --> 00:18:39.869
Brother!

00:18:39.869 --> 00:18:40.661
Go!

00:18:50.963 --> 00:18:52.214
Stop!

00:18:57.261 --> 00:19:01.057
Who knew he was Sorena's granddaughter.

00:19:01.724 --> 00:19:05.394
The guy tr yin' to burn her alive was Thirteen, right?

00:19:05.853 --> 00:19:09.899
Yeah, he was trying to get Albus to submit to him.

00:19:10.608 --> 00:19:14.904
Dunno how, but he must've known who he was.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.745
Hey, can you go faster?

00:19:22.745 --> 00:19:23.996
They're gonna catch up!

00:19:24.372 --> 00:19:27.750
| can't! They're pullin' a lotta weight!

00:19:29.085 --> 00:19:31.295
Then I'll just have to make it lighter!

00:19:47.061 --> 00:19:48.354
Whoa, there!

00:20:00.157 --> 00:20:01.367
You bastard!

00:20:08.666 --> 00:20:10.042
Let go of me!

00:20:17.508 --> 00:20:20.553
Brother, I got some good news and some bad news.

00:20:20.803 --> 00:20:22.471
Kinda in the middle of something here!

00:20:28.811 --> 00:20:32.148
| know the good news, what's the bad news?

00:20:32.815 --> 00:20:36.068
Truth is, the horses aren't listenin' to me!

00:20:36.277 --> 00:20:37.194
What?!

00:20:54.128 --> 00:20:54.879
Fall back!

00:21:08.225 --> 00:21:09.852
Is the kid alright?

00:21:10.102 --> 00:21:13.647
Yeah, but we've gotta get her warmed up, fast...

00:21:14.064 --> 00:21:16.192
They'll be on us in no time.

00:21:16.734 --> 00:21:18.569
We've gotta find a place to hide.

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:28.537
Send a message to His Highness immediately.

00:21:28.662 --> 00:21:29.288
Yes, sir!

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:36.545
A beastfallen would not die
simply from falling from a cliff.

00:21:36.921 --> 00:21:38.088
| know.

00:21:38.756 --> 00:21:41.217
Shall we send the Knights
of the Kingdom to follow them?

00:21:41.842 --> 00:21:43.511
We cannot rely on them.

00:21:44.261 --> 00:21:46.055
Send out the assassins.

00:21:46.347 --> 00:21:47.097
Yes, sir.

00:21:47.848 --> 00:21:50.142
| want them all alive.

00:22:18.921 --> 00:22:22.758
Take me with you

00:22:23.968 --> 00:22:29.557
Though I haven't decided where

00:22:32.393 --> 00:22:36.355
Sway me with you

00:22:37.439 --> 00:22:43.028
It doesn't matter if we go upside down

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:51.078
| thought staying here forever was alright

00:22:51.704 --> 00:22:58.127
Until the day I met you

00:22:58.419 --> 00:23:03.424
| want us to go on a search

00:23:03.591 --> 00:23:10.014
| want our futures to overlap

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:11.765
Becoming the light

00:23:11.765 --> 00:23:16.604
| want us to be tied together

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:23.068
It's fine if we want two worlds

00:23:23.402 --> 00:23:26.447
Let's go together

00:23:36.415 --> 00:23:41.003
EPISODE 9: REUNION
